};

app.use(cors(corsOptions));
```

#### 7. Missing Request Size Limits (OWASP A04:2021 – Insecure Design)
**Issue:** No limit on request body size, which could lead to DOS attacks.

**Recommendation:** Set body size limits.

```javascript
const express = require('express');
const app = express();

// Limit JSON body size
app.use(express.json({ limit: '10kb' }));

// Limit URL-encoded body size
app.use(express.urlencoded({ extended: true, limit: '10kb' }));
